sequenceDiagram
    participant Tenant
    participant ClientApp as Client Application
    participant APIServer as API Server
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant PropertyService as Property Service
    participant InquiryService as Inquiry Service
    participant DB as Database

    Tenant->>ClientApp: Login with email and password
    ClientApp->>APIServer: POST /api/auth/login
    APIServer->>Auth: Validate credentials
    Auth->>DB: Find user and verify password
    DB-->>Auth: User data
    Auth-->>APIServer: Access token
    APIServer-->>ClientApp: 200 OK + token

    Tenant->>ClientApp: Search properties
    ClientApp->>APIServer: GET /api/properties?filters
    APIServer->>PropertyService: Request filtered properties
    PropertyService->>DB: Query properties
    DB-->>PropertyService: Property list
    PropertyService-->>APIServer: Property list
    APIServer-->>ClientApp: 200 OK + properties

    Tenant->>ClientApp: Send inquiry for property
    ClientApp->>APIServer: POST /api/inquiries
    APIServer->>InquiryService: Create inquiry
    InquiryService->>DB: Insert inquiry and update property inquiry count
    DB-->>InquiryService: Inquiry saved
    InquiryService-->>APIServer: Inquiry created
    APIServer-->>ClientApp: 201 Created
